- Different character sets.
- Improvements to result presentation.
- New difficulty levels.
- Enhancements to the attempt simulation.
- Better code organisation and documentation.

## 10. Conclusion

CrackLab represents a practical application of C programming concepts and cybersecurity fundamentals.

In addition to demonstrating the conceptual operation of brute-force attacks, the project aims to highlight the importance of strong passwords and provide a learning experience involving programming logic, digital security and the development of educational tools.

